+/// portal half and its caster on the link ply draw nothing - so the search
+/// sees every draw within its horizon. An identical card joins its slot
+/// (count + 1); a new card takes the lowest free slot. Undo: the counts come
+/// back off the recorded draws, the bindings and the pointer with the state.
